<https://ogcincubator.github.io/ospd-activity-types/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - OSPD Activity Types Register" ;
    dct:abstract """The activity types of the OGC Open Science Persistent Demonstrator (OSPD), under stable
`https://w3id.org/ogc/ospd/activity-type/` URIs: the generic activity types, grouped into families.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """The activity types of OSPD and the model they are described with: the activity type, geoprocessing and
machine learning profiles of the Registered Item Model (`profiles/`), the catalogs (`core/`) and the generic
activity types, one block and one concept scheme per family (`generic/<family>`). Specific types are defined
by the participant registers, loaded from their ogcincubator forks, and point to a generic type with
`skos:broader`. This register supersedes the [Activity Type Register](https://ogcincubator.github.io/activity-type-register/).
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:modified "2026-11-27T18:31:51.378226"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    void:sparqlEndpoint <https://defs-hosted.opengis.net/fuseki-ospd/query> ;
    owl:imports <https://ogcincubator.github.io/registered-item-model/build/register.json>,
        <https://opengeospatial.github.io/bblocks/register.json> ;
